owd of cats, looking confused/ upset. Dovewing is laughing with other cats. Ivypool looks at her and walks away with fresh-k!ll in her jaws.\n\nPart 3:\nIvypool shakes her head, spits out her fresh-k!ll, and runs out of the camp, a determined look on her face.\n\nPart 4:\nIvypool is still running in the forest (try to make her lip sync) Show drawings of buttons and coats fly by her as she runs.\n\nPart 5:\nIvypool sees a mouse when hunting by herself and tries to catch it. She pounces, but misses and falls on her face. (try to make that in line with \"once in a while, I fall on my face!\") Then put wings on Ivypool's back, then make her look around and the wings fade away.\n\nPart 6:\nIvypool runs over to the barn (where they first saw daisy), hops on a stack of hay, and falls on her face.\n\nPart 7:\nIvypool looks out of the barn and sees a horse. Then, the horse suddenly grows an extra legs and Ivypool laughs.\n\nPart 8:\nIvypool runs onto Windclan. Show her feet and they turn into horse shoes.\n\nPart 9:\nIvypool is in a meadow smelling the flowers, then she goes onto her belly. Zoom out so that Ivypool is small and people can see no one is near her.\n\nPart 10:\nIvypool stands up in the meadow, make cats surround her (you pick who).\n\nPart 11:\nIvypool appears back in Thunderclan, do whatever.\n\nPart 12:\nDo whatever you want, but make sure to add Jayfeather, Lionblaze, and Dovewing for the magic part.\n\nPart 13:\nIvypool is lip syncing, and the camera zooms out and \"Thank you for watching\" pops up."}},"currentCostume":0,"costumes":[{"name":"Delete me!","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"eca2655bb4251309b6f834aad445b7b7","md5ext":"eca2655bb4251309b6f834aad445b7b7.svg","rotationCenterX":214.1129844640256,"rotationCenterY":158.5}],"sounds":[{"name":"1","assetId":"6487377efab25a3912d7895196cc5620","dataFormat":"wav","format":"","rate":44100,"sampleCount":1001759,"md5ext":"6487377efab25a3912d7895196cc5620.wav"},{"name":"2","assetId":"c8703e4e6b6